# Geo & phone inputs

Always use the shared npm-backed helpers — never free-text fields for these:

| Field | Use |
|---|---|
| Country / state / city | `LocationFields` or `GeoSelectField` from `~/components/geo` (`country-state-city` via `~/lib/geo`) |
| Pincode / postal / ZIP | `LocationFields` postal input + `validatePostalCode` from `~/lib/geo` |
| Mobile / phone | `PhoneInput` from `~/components/forms` (`libphonenumber-js` via `~/lib/phone`) |

Do not invent dial-code lists, country dropdowns, or phone length regexes in screens. Reuse `~/lib/geo` and `~/lib/phone`.
